  m_text: "There\u2019s a Nintendo DS that talks. Am I losing my mind? What the fuck
    is going on? I\u2019m hungry and thirsty. I think I\u2019ve been trapped in here
    for fucking days. As soon as I get out, I\u2019ll find whoever locked me in this
    shitty place. I need to find any other computer. I need an internet connection.
    I have to go up, but I can\u2019t make any fucking sense of this."
